sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Worker
    participant SH as Shopify GraphQL
    participant PM as Postmark

    S->>DB: Create candidate job
    W->>DB: Lock receivable/policy stage
    DB-->>W: Active, eligible, not sent
    W->>DB: Reserve unique delivery
    W->>SH: Fetch current payment state
    alt paid, canceled, suppressed, paused, or uncertain
        W->>DB: Cancel/defer with evidence
    else eligible
        W->>DB: Mark SENDING + immutable snapshot
        W->>PM: Send transactional email
        alt accepted
            PM-->>W: Provider message ID
            W->>DB: Mark ACCEPTED
        else definite rejection
            PM-->>W: Rejected before acceptance
            W->>DB: Mark safe failure / bounded retry
        else ambiguous timeout
            W->>DB: Mark UNKNOWN; prohibit auto-retry
        end
    end
